nia","r":[0.5065,0.7248,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Winter Icelea","r":[0.0815,0.7789,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Mask of the Virtuous Doctor","r":[0.5065,0.7789,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"},{"n":"Crown of Insight","r":[0.0815,0.833,0.0537,0.043],"k":"m"}]},{"img":"content/genshin/builds/prune/261111-225210/zh-3.webp","t":"content/genshin/builds/prune/261111-225210/zh-3.t.webp","w":1080,"h":1350,"kind":"why","links":[{"n":"Angelos' Heptades","r":[0.1093,0.2574,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"w"},{"n":"Oathsworn Eye","r":[0.1093,0.3211,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"w"},{"n":"Viridescent Venerer","r":[0.5231,0.2574,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Celestial Gift","r":[0.5231,0.3278,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Noblesse Oblige","r":[0.5231,0.3915,0.0426,0.0341],"k":"a"},{"n":"Prune","r":[0.0815,0.4978,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Varka","r":[0.1231,0.4978,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Durin","r":[0.1648,0.4978,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nicole","r":[0.2065,0.4978,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Prune","r":[0.0815,0.5548,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Venti","r":[0.1231,0.5548,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Durin","r":[0.1648,0.5548,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nicole","r":[0.2065,0.5548,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Prune","r":[0.0815,0.6059,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Lohen","r":[0.1231,0.6059,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Durin","r":[0.1648,0.6059,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Nicole","r":[0.2065,0.6059,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Prune","r":[0.0815,0.657,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Keqing","r":[0.1231,0.657,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Fischl","r":[0.1648,0.657,0.0343,0.0274]},{"n":"Kirara","r":[0.2065,0.657,0.0343,0.0274]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/prune/261111-225210/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Angelos' Heptades","text":"Exceptional base ATK helps reach the 4,000 ATK Tolling Rally cap. Its other effects are secondary to the stat value. Premium ATK option; do not pull just for Prune."},{"name":"Crane's Echoing Call","text":"High base ATK and ATK% help strengthen Tolling Rally; its Plunging Attack buff is mostly unused on typical Prune teams. Use if already owned; ER must be covered."},{"name":"Skyward Atlas","text":"High base ATK plus ATK% makes reaching the 4,000 ATK buff cap easier without relying on niche passive triggers. Enough Energy Recharge from artifacts and team."},{"name":"Memory of Dust","text":"ATK% stat and stackable ATK can improve Tolling Rally; gaining passive stacks needs field time, so do not assume maximum stacks. Lower value without time to build stacks."},{"name":"Oathsworn Eye","text":"High base ATK and ATK% improve her buffs."},{"name":"Flowing Purity","text":"Craftable high-base-ATK catalyst with ATK% for stronger Tolling Rally; its Skill damage passive is not why Prune uses it. Best when Energy Recharge is already sufficient."},{"name":"Hakushin Ring","text":"Energy Recharge eases Burst requirements; Electro-related reactions may provide a brief elemental DMG buff in Electro teams. Electro team; Prune must trigger a qualifying reaction."},{"name":"Favonius Codex","text":"Energy Recharge and CRIT-triggered neutral particles reduce steep Burst costs and help allies, at the expense of Prune's ATK buff. High-ER teams or teammates needing particles. Higher refinements improve consistency."}],"a":[{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Shreds 40% RES of the Swirled Pyro/Hydro/Electro/Cryo element when Prune triggers Swirl on-field; ideal for elemental carries.","stats":"ER/ATK% · ATK% · ATK% / CR (Fav)"},{"names":["Celestial Gift"],"text":"Alternative for Anemo-focused Hexerei teams or when Prune cannot Swirl the primary carry's element; check for an existing set holder.","stats":"ER/ATK% · ATK% · ATK%"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"After Burst, buffs party ATK by 20%.","stats":"ER/ATK% · ATK% · ATK%"}],"t":[{"name":"Witchhunter Vanguard","members":["Prune","Varka","Durin","Nicole"],"text":"Prune enables Varka's Hexerei Anemo bonuses and teamwide DMG buffs; Durin supplies elemental application and Nicole buffs Varka.","roles":["Buffer","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Witchwind Encore","members":["Prune","Venti","Durin","Nicole"],"text":"Venti activates Hexerei Anemo synergy and helps fund Prune's Burst; Durin maintains a Swirlable aura. Use an appropriate set holder.","roles":["Buffer","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Chimes of Frost","members":["Prune","Lohen","Durin","Nicole"],"text":"Prune grants Lohen teamwide DMG Bonus and supports Durin's off-field damage. Swirlable elemental application sustains Tolling Rally.","roles":["Buffer","Main DPS","Sub DPS","Support"]},{"name":"Keqing-A-Ling","members":["Prune","Keqing","Fischl","Kirara"],"text":"Accessible Aggravate team: Prune Swirls Electro for VV and buffs damage, Fischl supports Keqing, and Kirara supplies Dendro and shielding.","roles":["Anemo Buffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Shielder / Dendro Enabler"]}],"v":"Hexerei Anemo Carry: Pair with Varka or Venti and another Swirlable element; stack ER first, then ATK toward 4,000 with Hexerei buffs active.\nVV Electro Support: Use Viridescent Venerer and Swirl Electro on-field; Hakushin Ring can add conditional team buffs.\nAnemo-Focused Buffs: Use Celestial Gift when VV cannot shred the main Anemo carry's resistance; avoid duplicating an existing holder.\nHigh-ER / Favonius: Use Favonius Codex and some CRIT Rate when solo Anemo or Energy-starved; accept a smaller Tolling Rally buff.\nTTDS Niche: Only use Thrilling Tales with enough other ATK buffs to approach 4,000 ATK; swap directly to an ATK-scaling carry.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["Support / Buffer"],"about":"Prune is an off-field Anemo buffer whose converted hammer grants teammates Tolling Rally after a Swirl, providing up to 50% DMG Bonus based on her ATK above 2,000. Her Hexerei passive further boosts her ATK and Hexerei Anemo allies when two Hexerei units are present. Prioritize Burst uptime before ATK.","pros":["Up to 50% team DMG Bonus","Strong Hexerei Anemo synergy","Can equip Viridescent","C6 grants flat ATK"],"cons":["High Energy needs at C0","Needs reliable Swirl aura","4,000 ATK can be difficult","Limited personal damage"],"weapons":["Angelos' Heptades","Crane's Echoing Call","Skyward Atlas","Memory of Dust","Oathsworn Eye","Flowing Purity","Hakushin Ring","Favonius Codex"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best"},{"sets":["Celestial Gift"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""}],"main":["Energy Recharge / ATK%","ATK%","ATK% / CRIT Rate (Favonius)"],"stats":["ATK (buff active): up to 4,000","ER C0 double Anemo: 185% - 205%","ER C1-C5 double Anemo: 150% - 170%","ER C0 solo Anemo: 245% - 285%","ER C6 double Anemo: 140% - 160%"],"vars":[{"title":"Hexerei Anemo Buffer","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Angelos' Heptades","Oathsworn Eye","Skyward Atlas"],"arts":[{"sets":["Celestial Gift"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER to Burst every rotation, then ATK; count Hexerei-triggered 60% ATK toward the 4,000 cap.","teams":"Two Hexerei characters, an Anemo Hexerei carry and consistent Swirlable aura.","when":"For Varka/Venti-style teams where Prune grants 30% ATK to a Hexerei Anemo ally on qualifying Swirl.","cond":"Hexerei homework completed; two Hexerei in party.","notes":"4pc VV still suits a team with important Pyro/Hydro/Electro/Cryo damage.","pre":false},{"title":"Electro VV Support","role":"Off-field Buffer","weapons":["Hakushin Ring","Oathsworn Eye","Favonius Codex"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER first; ATK% afterward. CRIT Rate only if using Favonius.","teams":"Electro aura available for on-field Swirl; Electro damage dealers.","when":"For Keqing/Fischl and similar teams that value Electro RES shred and teamwide DMG Bonus.","cond":"Hakushin Ring requires Prune to trigger an Electro-related reaction.","notes":"Cast or hit with Anemo while on-field to activate VV RES shred.","pre":false},{"title":"Anemo Carry Artifact Flex","role":"Off-field Buffer","weapons":["Skyward Atlas","Crane's Echoing Call","Flowing Purity"],"arts":[{"sets":["Celestial Gift"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use ATK/ATK/ATK if ER met; ER Sands otherwise.","teams":"A primarily Anemo DPS; another character can already hold VV or Celestial Gift.","when":"Choose Celestial Gift when the primary damage is Anemo; use Noblesse if Celestial Gift already has a holder.","cond":"Do not duplicate team-wide artifact buffs unnecessarily.","notes":"4pc Celestial Gift is conditional; check team artifact ownership.","pre":false},{"title":"High-ER Solo Anemo","role":"Off-field Support","weapons":["Favonius Codex","Oathsworn Eye","Hakushin Ring"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"At C0 solo Anemo, start around 245-285% ER before weapon/particle reductions.","teams":"Solo Anemo team with a reliable Swirlable aura; Favonius helps energy.","when":"When her high Burst cost prevents every-rotation uptime; lower ATK is preferable to skipping Burst.","cond":"C1 and Favonius lower Energy needs substantially.","notes":"Aim for CRIT Rate if using Favonius; team ER needs vary.","pre":false},{"title":"TTDS Heavy-Buff Setup","role":"Off-field Buffer","weapons":["Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Skyward Atlas","Flowing Purity"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Celestial Gift"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Requires strong external ATK buffs; verify Prune approaches 4,000 ATK when Tolling Rally applies.","teams":"ATK-scaling on-field carry plus enough ATK boosts for Prune; swap order matters.","when":"Niche setup that layers TTDS onto Tolling Rally only when its low base ATK does not meaningfully weaken her own buff.","cond":"Use TTDS only if A4 buff remains near cap; R5 advised.","notes":"TTDS is generally worse without exceptional external ATK.","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Radiant Antler","Teachings of Resistance","Guide to Resistance","Philosophies of Resistance","Treasure Hoarder Insignia","Silver Raven Insignia","Golden Raven Insignia","Winter Icelea","Mask of the Virtuous Doctor","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 1-6"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9"}],"teams":[{"name":"Witchhunter Vanguard","members":["Prune","Varka","Durin","Nicole"]},{"name":"Witchwind Encore","members":["Prune","Venti","Durin","Nicole"]},{"name":"Chimes of Frost","members":["Prune","Lohen","Durin","Nicole"]},{"name":"Keqing-A-Ling","members":["Prune","Keqing","Fischl","Kirara"]}]}}],"title":"Prune","el":"Anemo"}